      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 505,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Make these sentences formal by using words and phrases from A opposite instead of the"
      },
      {
        "y": 83.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 365.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "underlined words, making any other necessary changes."
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 478.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 All that carbon-what’s-it-called gas put out by cars and factories is a major problem."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 461.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 These flowers here are a type there’s not many left of, so it’s illegal to pick them."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 483.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 A lot of wild animals have to survive in smaller and smaller areas where they can live."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 437.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 A lot of Patagonia is a completely spotless area that’s never been touched."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 488.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 We have to look after the things we use on this planet because they won’t last for ever."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 480.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 If the cutting down of trees continues, there will be no forest left ten years from now."
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 392.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "7 Burning coal and oil and stuff like that causes a lot of pollution."
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 392.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "8 The sea will get higher if this heating up of the world continues."
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 420.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "9 Increasing population puts really big pressure on economic resources."
      },
      {
        "y": 208,
        "x0": 110.3,
        "x1": 398.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "10 The way things all balance one another in nature is very delicate."
      },
      {
