      },
      {
        "y": 371.6,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 288.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Correct the mistakes in this paragraph."
      },
      {
        "y": 395.6,
        "x0": 123.3,
        "x1": 417.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Profits of boom and gloom are always saying that we are heading for"
      },
      {
        "y": 407.6,
        "x0": 123.3,
        "x1": 412.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "an environmental catastrophe, and that unless we adopt a policy of"
      },
      {
        "y": 419.6,
        "x0": 123.3,
        "x1": 406.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "attainable development, we will cause irreparable damages to the"
      },
      {
        "y": 431.6,
        "x0": 123.3,
        "x1": 431.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "planet. The worst-place scenery is of a world choked by overpopulation,"
      },
      {
        "y": 443.6,
